VoxCPM-csharp
Copyright 2026 VoxCPM C# port contributors

This product is a C# port of VoxCPM (https://github.com/OpenBMB/VoxCPM),
Copyright OpenBMB, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The network, sampler and pre/post-processing are re-implemented in C# from its
Python source (modified: rewritten for TorchSharp; training, LoRA, text
normalization, denoising and timestamps are not included). Files ported from
VoxCPM carry a "Ported from VoxCPM" header naming the original modules.

Parts of this product are derived from Irodori-TTS-csharp, licensed under the
MIT License. Files derived from it carry a "Derived from Irodori-TTS-csharp"
header:
  src/VoxCpm/Audio/*, src/VoxCpm/IO/*,
  src/VoxCpm/Text/BpeTokenizer.cs, src/VoxCpm/Text/ISubwordTokenizer.cs,
  src/VoxCpm/Text/TokenizerNormalizers.cs,
  src/VoxCpm.Server/AudioFormats.cs, src/VoxCpm.Server/Program.cs,
  src/VoxCpm.Server/ServerApp.cs, src/VoxCpm.Server/SpeechChunker.cs,
  src/VoxCpm.Server/SpeechOptions.cs, src/VoxCpm.Server/VoiceStore.cs

